eOtherShore,ShootingSquare,TeamBrawl,DesertTown,UndergroundPalace.SpaceSquare,ShootTheZombie,IndividualBrawl,TeamCap,WesternRanger,GunHunter, DungeonHunter,MazeTrial, CrazyThrowing, LoopsFly, LostMaze, GunDuel.\n\nIncluding action, adventure, strategy, role-playing, rodeo, shooting and more, and constantly updated...\n\nOnline Adventure\n\nSome games in Dreamland are very difficult. If you encounter difficult levels during the game, you can invite friends to work together to overcome them.\n\nDreamland is a world full of imagination and adventure, waiting for you to explore and discover. Join us and embark on your adventure!", "short_description": "Dreamland is a free virtual reality multiplayer game, a mysterious and imaginative world where you will experience a wonderful adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/DreamlandPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "App Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1338223150090766"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3378951108992639"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3378951108992639"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1687656600, "status": 